# The release shipped without a .gitignore. This one only covers build output and
# bulky reference material, so that tools/manifest-check.sh does not have to
# reason about artefacts. It must never be used to hide changes to EVA Admin
# source -- the manifest check is the control for that.

# Maven build output
target/

# Reference material: manuals and portal copies are large and externally owned.
# docs/reference/INDEX.md records what belongs here, with checksums.
docs/reference/manuals/*
!docs/reference/manuals/.gitkeep
docs/reference/valgmedarbeiderportalen/*
!docs/reference/valgmedarbeiderportalen/.gitkeep

# Editors
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
